1343..1417 Comment "/// A forged section: the loop arm answers with the rest\'s path unchanged,"
1418..1496 Comment "/// typed at the motive at `q`, where the arm owes the motive at `loop ∷ q`:"
1497..1575 Comment "/// a path from `loop ∷ spin(wind(q))` to `loop ∷ q`. The machine does not"
1576..1643 Comment "/// decide the two path types, and the arm is refused as undecided."
